;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\流るる時.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\江戸パノラマ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n120000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> had put the Noh mask on again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Naturally, this strange getup drew the attention of the people around us.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But that was fine.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This way, he would pass as nothing more than a man in odd clothes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Westerners were still rare here in Tokyo, so I had suggested that he wear the Noh mask.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Paying no mind to the eyes around us, </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> and I walked side by side and told each other where we came from.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Why were we, meeting for the first time, able to talk without much wariness?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">There were two reasons.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One was that I was very interested in Western culture.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1">, though Japanese, had a Westerner among his ancestors, and in his homeland, a place called Arata, Western culture still remained even now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">And the other was </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1">'s character.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> had apparently never left Arata before, and he said he did not know how he ought to deal with people from outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So he was having trouble judging how much of </STYLE>his own<STYLE ID="1"> background he could reveal.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Arata, it seemed, had always been closed to outsiders by nature, but since coming here to Tokyo, </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> had come into contact with its advanced culture and was very excited about it.</STYLE><PG>
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> was 16, the same as me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He had come here to Tokyo as Arata's representative, it seemed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> had come from Arata to Tokyo, so he said, to present a certain thing to the Emperor.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But, understandably, he would not tell me what it was he was presenting.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed he had been </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="くぎ">strictly warned</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> never to speak of this one thing except at the presentation itself.</STYLE><PG>
"I see. So <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-dono</STYLE>, you're eagerly studying Western culture so as not to fall <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="おく">behind</STYLE> the Great Powers."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. Father is always </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="しか">scolding</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> me, telling me a woman mustn't act so forward."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A woman acting forward...?
{PAUSE ""}
　Is that a bad thing?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
"No, it's just that in my homeland, women govern the whole settlement. 
{PAUSE ""}
It isn't 'because you're a man' or 'because you're a woman': the natural order is that the capable lead everyone. And everyone supports the capable ones. 
{PAUSE ""}
One for all, and all for one."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">To think there was a place with such an ideal culture.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> called the culture of Tokyo advanced.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But to me, it was Arata's way of thinking, its spirit of helping one another, that was truly advanced.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\江戸城.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶらバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Well, I'll be off, then. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-dono</STYLE>, thank you for guiding me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Not at all... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">U-uh, how soon will you be back...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, I couldn't say... 
{PAUSE ""}
What's the matter?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"If you don't mind, </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="3">, I was hoping we could talk a little longer."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> tilted his head slightly.</STYLE><PG>
"I'm sorry, but once my business is done, I have to go straight back to Arata..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, I'll be off, then."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1"> went on to the castle just like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Such a fine person<STYLE ID="1">, and I had thought I was lucky to meet him. What a shame...</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
